data: {"id": "9f68d031f5474904-thinking-parallel_evidence-978", "run_id": "9f68d031f5474904", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 2. 证据结论与分析\n\n基于真实工具返回的事实，针对 `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-nqrzv` 的调查结论如下：\n\n#### 已采集事实\n1. **Kubernetes 状态 (kubectl describe)**:\n    - Pod 处于 `Pending` 状态，容器 `app` 处于 `Waiting` 状态，原因正是 `ImagePullBackOff`。\n    - **核心错误原文**：`failed to pull and unpack image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": failed to resolve reference ... failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host`。\n2. **P", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788765817331, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

